+/*
+ * STMicroelectronics FingerTipS (FTS521) on UMI:
+ * Touch events are retrieved from an 8-byte event FIFO using command 0x86 (FIFO_CMD_READALL).
+ * Event IDs:
+ *   0x00 = NO EVENT
+ *   0x03 = CONTROLLER READY (re-arm active sensing)
